<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Support – Carbon</title>
  <%- include('style') %>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Carbon App Support</h1>
    <p>Need help with the Carbon member app? We're here.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      <% if (contactEmail) { %>Email <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a>, or speak<% } else { %>Speak<% } %>
      to the front desk at any Carbon branch.
    </p>

    <h2>Common questions</h2>
    <h3>I forgot my password</h3>
    <p>On the login screen tap <em>Forgot password</em>. We'll email you a 6-digit code to set a new one.</p>

    <h3>The QR check-in doesn't work</h3>
    <p>Make sure you've allowed camera access for Carbon in your phone's settings and that you have an active package
      with sessions left. If it still fails, the front desk can check you in.</p>

    <h3>I'm not getting notifications</h3>
    <p>Check that notifications are allowed for Carbon in your phone's settings, and that they're switched on in
      <em>Profile → Preferences</em> in the app.</p>

    <h3>How do I delete my account?</h3>
    <p>In the app go to <em>Profile → Delete account</em> and confirm with your password. You can also ask the front
      desk to delete it for you.</p>

    <p class="muted"><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
